- Filter real-person, trademarked-character and sexualised prompts
- Add /about and /contact pages, link them in the footer
- Privacy policy: disclose AdSense / Google ad cookies and opt-outs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
